# Canonical starting puzzle: every executable byte is a literal binary token.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111000 00110100 00010010 # instruction | MOV AX,1234 | Initialize the word to store.
10100010 00000000 00000110 # instruction | MOV [0600],AL | A2 stores only the low byte, leaving the second byte unwritten.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop after the partial store.
